    {"name":"Personality scoring from public data","found_in":["Crystal"],"reason":"DISC/MBTI on people without consent. CNIL / GDPR red flag in EU. Drift toward judgment."},
    {"name":"Public leaderboard of writing scores","found_in":["Lavender consumer mode"],"reason":"Public ranking of employees on writing quality is degrading and chills honesty."},
    {"name":"\"Deal health\" red/yellow/green per individual","found_in":["Gong"],"reason":"Treats colour as truth. Invites manager laziness — the dashboard makes the call."},
    {"name":"Calendar hard-block auto-bookings","found_in":["Reclaim aggressive mode","Motion"],"reason":"Loss of autonomy. Prescription where description was needed. Calendar proposals must be opt-in."},
    {"name":"Auto-recording every 1:1 by default","found_in":["Spinach","Fellow"],"reason":"Freezes candor. Recording must be explicit, opt-in, per session. Most EU works councils would refuse the default."},
    {"name":"Agent autonomously acts on tickets","found_in":["Linear AI / Codex","Asana AI Teammates"],"reason":"Translated to perf: AI auto-writing review text and submitting. Removes the human signature; legally fraught (FR requires manager-signed appraisals)."},
    {"name":"Cross-employee retrieval (\"show me everyone who…\")","found_in":["Glean misconfigured","Workday Insights"],"reason":"Becomes ranking infrastructure. Permissioned RAG is fine; cross-employee retrieval is not."},
    {"name":"Coaching transcripts shared with manager","found_in":["Bravely mis-port"],"reason":"Confidentiality is the product. Breaking it kills the value."},
    {"name":"Talk-time ratio metrics on 1:1s","found_in":["Gong-style"],"reason":"Quantifies the wrong thing as proxy for quality. Classic Goodhart."},
    {"name":"Mandatory specificity that blocks submission","found_in":["aggressive Effy modes"],"reason":"Turns 'help' into 'obstruction.' Specificity coaches must always have an escape."},
    {"name":"AI bias auto-redaction without showing the change","found_in":["Macorva aggressive mode"],"reason":"Robs the reviewer of the learning moment. Suggest, don't silently write."},
    {"name":"AI-summarized 1:1 transcripts kept by default","found_in":["Spinach","Fellow"],"reason":"1:1 is between two people. Recording + summarizing changes the trust dynamic. Manager logs their own typed notes; system never listens."},
    {"name":"\"Signed by AI\" review artifacts","found_in":["various draft-and-sign demos"],"reason":"EU AI Act high-risk obligations require named human accountability. AI can draft; only a human signs."},
